"\t\t\t\t\tWhich of the following would be the best first line of a <em>proof by contrapositive</em> if you wanted to prove the statement, <q>For all sets <m>A</m> of single-digit numbers, if <m>|A| = 6</m>, then <m>A</m> contains an even number.</q>\n"
