"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIncorrect.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWe are trying to prove the contrapositive, so assume the if part of the contrapositive.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTry again.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <section><reading-questions><exercise><choices><choice><feedback><p>
#: source/sec_logic-proofs.ptx:1522 source/sec_logic-proofs.ptx:1539
#, no-wrap
