"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe contrapositive of <m>P \\imp Q</m> is <m>\\neg Q \\imp \\neg P</m>.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tProofs by contrapositive should start by assuming <m>\\neg Q</m>.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTry again.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t"
msgstr ""

