#. type: Content of: <worksheet><introduction><p>
#: source/activities/four-proofs.ptx:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\t\t\tWhich of the proofs below appear to be valid proofs of this statement?  Note: You can assume all the algebra below is correct (because it is).\n"
