#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/logic-proofs.ptx:492
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        Suppose you have a collection of rare 5-cent stamps and 8-cent stamps.\n"
"        You desperately need to mail a letter and, having no other stamps available, decide to dip into your collection.  The question is, what amounts of postage can you make?\n"
