#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p><ol><li><p>
#: source/exercises/logic-proofs.ptx:498
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"              Prove that if you only use an even number of both types of stamps, the amount of postage you make must be even.\n"
