#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/logic-proofs.ptx:531
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        Prove: <m>x=y</m> if and only if <m>xy=\\dfrac{(x+y)^2}{4}</m>.\n"
