#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/logic-proofs.ptx:545
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        Prove that <m>\\log(7)</m> is irrational.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><hint><p>
#: source/exercises/logic-proofs.ptx:550
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        Note that if <m>\\log(7) = \\frac{a}{b}</m>, then <m>7 = 10^\\frac{a}{b}</m>.  Can any power of 7 be the same as a power of 10?\n"
