", 10, J, Q, K).\n"
"        If you draw some number of cards at random, you might or might not have a pair\n"
"        (two cards with the same value)\n"
"        or three cards all of the same suit.\n"
"        However, if you draw enough cards,\n"
"        you will be guaranteed to have these.\n"
"        For each of the following,\n"
"        find the smallest number of cards you would need to draw to be guaranteed having the specified cards.\n"
"        Prove your answers.\n"
"\n"
"        "
