msgid ""
"                      Given sets <m>A</m> and <m>B</m>, the <term>union</term> of <m>A</m> and <m>B</m>, written <m>A \\cup B</m>, is the set containing every element that is in <m>A</m> or <m>B</m> or both.\n"
