#: source/exercises/gt-intro.ptx:420
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            Not possible.\n"
"            If you have a graph with 5 vertices all of degree 4, then every vertex must be adjacent to every other vertex.\n"
"            This is the graph <m>K_5</m>.\n"
"          "
