"    Actually, all the graphs above are just <em>drawings</em> of graphs.\n"
"    A graph is really an abstract mathematical object consisting of two sets <m>V</m> and <m>E</m>, where <m>E</m> is a set of 2-element subsets of <m>V</m>.\n"
"    Are the graphs below the same or different? "
