#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/gt-trees.ptx:386
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      Let <m>T</m> be a rooted tree that contains vertices <m>u</m>, <m>v</m>, and <m>w</m> (among others, possibly).\n"
"      Prove that if <m>w</m> is a descendant of both <m>u</m> and <m>v</m>, then <m>u</m> is a descendant of <m>v</m> or <m>v</m> is a descendant of <m>u</m>.\n"
"    "
