#. type: Content of: <section><subsection><image><description>
#: source/sec_gt-planar.ptx:124
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"          Another drawing of K2,3.  A single vertex on a top row is adjacent to three vertices in a row below it.  Each of these vertices are adjacent to a single vertex below (and to the right of) them.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <section><subsection><p>
#: source/sec_gt-planar.ptx:131
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      The graphs are the same, so if one is planar, the other must be, too.\n"
"      However, the original drawing of the graph was not a\n"
"      <term>planar representation</term> of the graph.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <section><subsection><p><idx><see>
#: source/sec_gt-planar.ptx:138 source/sec_gt-planar.ptx:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "face (planar graph)"
