#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/gt-coloring.ptx:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        What is the smallest number of colors you need to properly color the vertices of <m>K_{4,5}</m>?\n"
"        That is, find the chromatic number of the graph.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><solution><p>
#: source/exercises/gt-coloring.ptx:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        2, since the graph is bipartite.\n"
"        One color for the top set of vertices,\n"
"        another color for the bottom set of vertices.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/gt-coloring.ptx:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        Draw a graph with chromatic number 6 (i.e., which requires 6 colors to properly color the vertices).\n"
"        Could your graph be planar?\n"
"        Explain.\n"
"      "
