"            What is the relationship between the size of the minimal vertex cover and the size of the maximal partial matching in a graph?\n"
"          "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/gt-matchings.ptx:341
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        For many applications of matchings,\n"
"        it makes sense to use bipartite graphs.\n"
"        You might wonder, however,\n"
"        whether there is a way to find matchings in graphs in general.\n"
"\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p><ol><li>
#: source/exercises/gt-matchings.ptx:348
#, no-wrap
