#: source/sec_counting-combine-outcomes.ptx:109
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHow many ways can you select a card which is either a face card <em>or</em> a red card?\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t"
