#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"          Suppose you, like the 17th-century French nobleman Chevalier de Mere, liked gambling on the outcome of rolling fair 6-sided dice (each numbered 1 to 6). Would you bet him that he couldn't roll at least one 6 in four rolls of a single die?  What about betting that he couldn't roll at least one double-6 in 24 rolls of both dice?  \n"
"        "
