#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p><ol><li><p>
#: source/exercises/counting-conc.ptx:190
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"              From your home at (0,0) you want to go to either the donut shop at (5,4) or the one at (3,6).\n"
"              How many paths could you take?\n"
