"              The sequence of partial sums is <m>1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, \\ldots</m>.  A recursive definition is (as always) <m>b_n = b_{n-1} + a_n</m> which in this case is <m>b_n = b_{n-1} + 2n-1</m>.  It appears that the closed formula is <m>b_n = n^2</m>\n"
"            "
