#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/seq-basics.ptx:147
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        Show that <m>a_n = 3\\cdot 2^n + 7\\cdot 5^n</m> is a solution to the recurrence relation <m>a_n = 7a_{n-1} - 10a_{n-2}</m>.\n"
"        What would the initial conditions need to be for this to be the closed formula for the sequence?\n"
