"        <m>a_{n-1} = 3\\cdot 2^{n-1} + 7 \\cdot 5^{n-1}</m> and <m>a_{n-2} = 3\\cdot 2^{n-2} + 7 \\cdot 5^{n-2}</m>.\n"
"        Then we would have\n"
"        "
