#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        Let <m>t_n</m> denote the number of ways to tile a <m>2\\times n</m> chessboard using <m>1\\times 2</m> dominoes.  Write out the first few terms of the sequence <m>(t_n)_{n \\ge 1}</m>, and then give a recursive definition.  Explain why your recursive formula is correct. \n"
