#, no-wrap
msgid "Rate of Growth"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <section><objectives><ol><li><p>
#: source/sec_seq-growth.ptx:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"          Identify a sequence as arithmetic or geometric based on its rate of growth.\n"
