#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><statement><p>
#: source/practice/seq-polynomial.ptx:130
#, no-wrap
msgid "      Suppose <m>a_n = {2n^{2}+3n+2}\\text{.}</m> Find a closed formula for the sequence of differences by computing <m>a_n - a_{n-1}\\text{.}</m>  Simplify your answer as much as possible."
