#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><task><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/seq-strong-induction.ptx:166
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"              First fix <m>m = 0</m>, and give a proof by mathematical induction that <m>P(0,n)</m> holds for all <m>n \\ge 0</m>.\n"
"              Note that this proof will be very easy.\n"
"            "
