#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><task><statement><p>
#: source/exercises/seq-strong-induction.ptx:184
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"              You can now conclude that <m>P(m,n)</m> holds for all <m>m,n\\ge 0</m>.\n"
"              Do you believe that?\n"
"              Explain why this sort of induction is valid.\n"
"              For example,\n"
"              why do your proofs above guarantee that <m>P(2,3)</m> is true?\n"
"            "
msgstr ""

