#. type: Content of: <section><introduction><investigation><p><ol><li><p>
#: source/sec_seq-conc.ptx:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"              Find a closed formula for the <m>n</m>th term of the sequence, and prove it is correct by induction.\n"
"            "
