#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><solution><p>
#: source/practice/intro-functions.ptx:582
#: source/exercises/intro-functions.ptx:772
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        Yes, this is a function, if you choose the domain and codomain correctly. The domain will be\n"
"        the set of students, and the codomain will be the set of possible grades. The function is\n"
"        almost certainly not injective, because it is likely that two students will get the same\n"
"        grade. The function might be surjective "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <exercises><exercise><solution><p>
